### GET alle trips
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trips
Accept: application/json

### GET trip by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trips/1
Accept: application/json

### GET alle trips van een specifieke user
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trips/user/1
Accept: application/json

### POST nieuwe trip
POST http://localhost:8080/api/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "tripName": "Zomervakantie Mallorca",
  "startDate": "2025-08-05",
  "endDate": "2025-08-08",
  "destination": "Palma de Mallorca",
  "description": "Heerlijke vakantie met zon, zee en strand",
  "isActive": true
}

### PUT trip updaten
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/trips/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "tripName": "Zomervakantie Mallorca - geüpdatet",
  "startDate": "2025-08-05",
  "endDate": "2025-08-08",
  "destination": "Palma de Mallorca",
  "description": "Vakantie geüpdatet met extra activiteiten",
  "isActive": true
}

### DELETE trip
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/trips/1
